    { q: "How far in advance should I book?", a: "We recommend booking at least 1-2 weeks in advance, especially during peak season (May through September). Weekends fill up fast, and popular units like our water slides can be booked out weeks ahead. That said, if you need something last minute, give us a call — we will do our best to accommodate you!" },
