    { q: "Are you insured?", a: "Bounce Man LLC is fully insured with commercial general liability coverage. Safety and professionalism are at the core of everything we do. A Certificate of Insurance (COI) is available upon request." },
    { q: "What is your cancellation policy?", a: "Your deposit is non-refundable, but can be applied to a future date if you need to reschedule. For weather cancellations, we'll reschedule — or issue a full refund if that doesn't work. We always try to work with you!" },
    { q: "Can I rent multiple items?", a: "Of course! Many customers rent a bounce house plus a water slide, or add tables and chairs to their bounce house booking. You can add multiple items during the booking process. We also offer package deals that bundle popular items together at a discounted price." },
    { q: "How do I clean up after the event?", a: "You do not have to! We handle all the cleanup. When your rental time is up, our team returns to deflate, pack up, and haul everything away. The only thing we ask is that you remove any debris, food, or personal items from inside the inflatable before we arrive for pickup. We take care of the rest." }
  ];

  var schema = {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'FAQPage',
